  description: '3 Level 5 WATER monsters

    You can also Xyz Summon this card
    by using "Number 37: Hope Woven Dragon Spider Shark" you control (transfer its
    materials to this card). Once per turn: You can detach 1 material from this card,
    then target 1 monster your opponent controls; banish it (until their next Standby
    Phase), and if you do, any monsters they currently control lose 1000 ATK until
    the end of this turn. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card is in
    your GY because this Xyz Summoned card was destroyed and sent there this turn:
    You can Special Summon it.'
